          "description": "What pressing the chip does: one surface action, or a list run in order — the same actions as control.button. Resolved per repeated copy (item, index), so a chip in a repeated strip can drop exactly its own row. A removable chip runs it from its × too, so for a filter in force this is the removal. With href set, pressing the label follows the link instead."
